# Cnfigurating nerd-font preset
# source: https://starship.rs/presets/nerd-font

# install prerequisites
# fnt must be installed first ... see `../fnt/README.md`

# update fnt
# fnt update

# install font
# fnt install fonts-firacode
brew install --cask font-fira-code
# brew install font-fira-code

# A Nerd Font installed and enabled in your terminal (the example uses Fira Code Nerd Font)
# starship preset nerd-font-symbols -o ~/.config/starship.toml